---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Shows">

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-white text-gray-800">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="prose prose-lg mx-auto text-gray-800">
                <div class="mb-8">
                    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold font-heading text-kom-navy tracking-tight mb-2">
                        Upcoming Shows
                    </h1>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-heading text-kom-blue tracking-tight">
                            URINETOWN THE MUSICAL
                        </h2>
                        <a 
                            href="https://www.yesticket.org/events/en/kind-of-musical/" 
                            target="_blank" 
                            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                            class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md font-bold text-white bg-kom-orange-dark hover:bg-kom-orange-light shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200"
                        >
                            Tickets
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xl font-medium text-kom-orange-dark">
                        The triple Tony Award-winning musical comes to Berlin!
                    </p>
                </div>
                
                <p class="mb-6 font-semibold">
                    Theatre Pool Berlin Oct 2-4, 8-10 | Doors at 19:00, Show at 19:30<br>
                    Performed in English
                </p>

                <p class="mb-4">
                    Welcome to Urinetown, The Musical! Not the place, of course. Urinetown the place is something you’ll hear a lot about over the course of the show. But this here is the Berlin debut of Urinetown, The Musical, brought to you by the mad genius of the kind of musical team.
                </p>
                <p class="mb-4">
                    Urinetown is set in a dystopian, not-so-distant-future, where a catastrophic water shortage has led to a ban on private toilets. Citizens are forced to resort to public bathrooms, where the prices are controlled by a single powerful corporation. Enter a hero, who decides to throw off the shackles of oppressive incontinence and lead the people to urinary freedom!
                </p>
                <p class="mb-8">
                    This triple Tony-award winning musical satire features something for everyone: capitalism, resource scarcity, corporate greed, state propaganda, inequality, environmental crises, love, Brechtian fourth-wall breaks, populism, Malthusian economics, revenge, rebellion, and more silly walks than you can shake a stick at. Because Urinetown, The Musical, is here to take the piss (ha) out of musical theatre itself.
                </p>

                <div class="mb-8">
                    <a href="https://www.yesticket.org/events/en/kind-of-musical/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-kom-blue underline font-bold hover:text-kom-orange-dark">
                        kind of musical from Berlin Tickets and vouchers for Amateurtheater order
                    </a>
                </div>

                <p class="mb-16">
                    Urinetown, The Musical has been partially funded on Startnext. We have financed all our productions through the generosity of our community, who have shown us inspiring levels of support during our crowdfunding campaigns. For that, we say thank you.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-heading text-kom-navy tracking-tight mb-4 pt-10 border-t border-gray-200">
                    Past shows: The Guy Who Didn’t Like Musicals
                </h2>
                
                <p class="mb-4">
                    Our debut production. Performed April 4–6 and 11–12, 2025 at Theatre Pool Berlin.<br>
                    Funded on Startnext
                </p>

                <!-- Photos for past show -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8">
                    <img src="/img/the_guy/Copy of 0J0A1968.webp" class="zoomable-image cursor-pointer rounded-lg h-48 w-full object-cover hover:scale-[1.02] hover:opacity-95 transition-all duration-300" alt="" />
                    <img src="/img/the_guy/Copy of 0J0A2369.webp" class="zoomable-image cursor-pointer rounded-lg h-48 w-full object-cover hover:scale-[1.02] hover:opacity-95 transition-all duration-300" alt="" />
                    <img src="/img/the_guy/Copy of 0J0A2572.webp" class="zoomable-image cursor-pointer rounded-lg h-48 w-full object-cover hover:scale-[1.02] hover:opacity-95 transition-all duration-300" alt="" />
                    <img src="/img/the_guy/Copy of 0J0A2961.webp" class="zoomable-image cursor-pointer rounded-lg h-48 w-full object-cover hover:scale-[1.02] hover:opacity-95 transition-all duration-300" alt="" />
                    <img src="/img/the_guy/Copy of 0J0A3167.webp" class="zoomable-image cursor-pointer rounded-lg h-48 w-full object-cover hover:scale-[1.02] hover:opacity-95 transition-all duration-300" alt="" />
                    <img src="/img/the_guy/Copy of 0J0A4112.webp" class="zoomable-image cursor-pointer rounded-lg h-48 w-full object-cover hover:scale-[1.02] hover:opacity-95 transition-all duration-300" alt="" />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
